{
  "episode": "ep01",
  "title": "日本の歴史、ここから始まる!〜縄文・弥生・古墳〜",
  "gaps": {
    "beat": 0.3,
    "scene": 0.6,
    "section": 0.8,
    "tail": 0.6
  },
  "total_duration": 791.987,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "section": "opening",
      "start": 0.0,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b00.wav",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 4.971,
          "text": "ねえ先生、昔の人って本当にお米を食べてなかったの？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b01.wav",
          "start": 5.271,
          "duration": 7.771,
          "text": "実は、その「お米」こそが、日本の歴史を変えたんです!その理由は、本編で順番に見ていきましょう。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b02.wav",
          "start": 13.342,
          "duration": 2.531,
          "text": "よし、縄文からスタートなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 16.673,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b00.wav",
          "start": 16.673,
          "duration": 4.011,
          "text": "先生!最初の時代って、どんな時代なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b01.wav",
          "start": 20.984,
          "duration": 5.411,
          "text": "何万年も前の氷河の時代には、もう日本に人が住んでいました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b02.wav",
          "start": 26.695,
          "duration": 2.371,
          "text": "これが旧石器時代です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b03.wav",
          "start": 29.366,
          "duration": 4.491,
          "text": "土器がまだ無いので、先土器時代と呼ぶこともあるんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b04.wav",
          "start": 34.157,
          "duration": 4.131,
          "text": "ふぇ?食器が無いと、ごはんはどうしてたのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b05.wav",
          "start": 38.588,
          "duration": 4.811,
          "text": "まだ煮込みはできないので、焼いたり生で食べたりしていたようです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b06.wav",
          "start": 43.699,
          "duration": 3.931,
          "text": "道具は、石を打ち欠けて作る打製石器。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b07.wav",
          "start": 47.93,
          "duration": 4.091,
          "text": "ナイフのように使って動物を狩っていました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b08.wav",
          "start": 52.321,
          "duration": 3.611,
          "text": "旧石器って、古い石をあつめて作ったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b09.wav",
          "start": 56.231,
          "duration": 3.211,
          "text": "いいえ、石を打ち欠けて道具を作るんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b10.wav",
          "start": 59.742,
          "duration": 3.051,
          "text": "古い石を集めるわけじゃないんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b11.wav",
          "start": 63.093,
          "duration": 2.571,
          "text": "石のナイフ、かっこいいのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 66.264,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b00.wav",
          "start": 66.264,
          "duration": 4.371,
          "text": "やがて氷河が解けて気候がぐんと暖かくなり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b01.wav",
          "start": 70.935,
          "duration": 5.651,
          "text": "大きく見て約1万年前から、縄文時代が始まります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b02.wav",
          "start": 76.886,
          "duration": 2.011,
          "text": "くらしはどう変わるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b03.wav",
          "start": 79.197,
          "duration": 3.931,
          "text": "森と海のめぐみが増えて、狩りや釣り、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b04.wav",
          "start": 83.428,
          "duration": 3.811,
          "text": "木の実採りで安定して暮らせるようになったんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b05.wav",
          "start": 87.539,
          "duration": 5.811,
          "text": "道具も進化します。石を磨いて作る磨製石器の登場です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b06.wav",
          "start": 93.65,
          "duration": 4.051,
          "text": "矢じりを磨いた弓矢で、イノシシなどを狩りました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b07.wav",
          "start": 98.001,
          "duration": 3.411,
          "text": "打製から磨製へ、石の進化なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b08.wav",
          "start": 101.712,
          "duration": 4.011,
          "text": "そのとおり。時代が変わると、道具も変わる。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b09.wav",
          "start": 106.023,
          "duration": 2.291,
          "text": "わかりやすい証拠なんですよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 108.914,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b00.wav",
          "start": 108.914,
          "duration": 4.331,
          "text": "縄文時代のイメージといえば、もようのついた壺なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b01.wav",
          "start": 113.545,
          "duration": 3.131,
          "text": "鋭いですね!それが縄文土器。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b02.wav",
          "start": 116.976,
          "duration": 2.651,
          "text": "紐を巻いた棒で転がして、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b03.wav",
          "start": 119.927,
          "duration": 3.691,
          "text": "縄のもようを付けたことが名前の由来なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b04.wav",
          "start": 123.918,
          "duration": 2.451,
          "text": "しかも驚きなのですが、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b05.wav",
          "start": 126.669,
          "duration": 4.211,
          "text": "縄文土器は世界でいちばん古い土器のひとつなんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b06.wav",
          "start": 131.18,
          "duration": 6.251,
          "text": "青森では約1万6500年前の土器も見つかっています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b07.wav",
          "start": 137.731,
          "duration": 4.131,
          "text": "日本の土器が世界最古級なのだ!?すごいのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b08.wav",
          "start": 142.162,
          "duration": 2.891,
          "text": "土器で煮込み料理ができるようになって、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b09.wav",
          "start": 145.353,
          "duration": 4.651,
          "text": "くらしがぐっと豊かになり、村での定住も進みました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b10.wav",
          "start": 150.304,
          "duration": 5.211,
          "text": "縄文土器=世界最古級、煮込み料理で定住。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b11.wav",
          "start": 155.815,
          "duration": 3.051,
          "text": "このつながり、おぼえておくと便利です。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 159.465,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b00.wav",
          "start": 159.465,
          "duration": 3.691,
          "text": "縄文の人は、どんな家に住んでいたのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b01.wav",
          "start": 163.456,
          "duration": 4.971,
          "text": "地面に穴を掘って、周りに柱を立てる竪穴住居です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b02.wav",
          "start": 168.727,
          "duration": 4.371,
          "text": "半分地下のような、暖かくて丈夫な家なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b03.wav",
          "start": 173.398,
          "duration": 4.011,
          "text": "冬も暖かそうなのだ!夏も涼しいのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b04.wav",
          "start": 177.709,
          "duration": 0.691,
          "text": "ええ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b05.wav",
          "start": 178.7,
          "duration": 5.211,
          "text": "しかも数十軒の家が円形に並ぶ環状集落が、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b06.wav",
          "start": 184.211,
          "duration": 2.211,
          "text": "各地で見つかっているんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b07.wav",
          "start": 186.722,
          "duration": 4.051,
          "text": "みんなで丸くなって暮らすのだ!キャンプ場みたいなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b08.wav",
          "start": 191.073,
          "duration": 2.411,
          "text": "仲間と集まって暮らすことで、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b09.wav",
          "start": 193.784,
          "duration": 2.971,
          "text": "長く同じ場所に住めるようになったんです。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 197.355,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b00.wav",
          "start": 197.355,
          "duration": 3.211,
          "text": "縄文の人は、毎日なにをしてたのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b01.wav",
          "start": 200.866,
          "duration": 4.451,
          "text": "弓矢で狩りをし、釣り針や銛で漁をして、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b02.wav",
          "start": 205.617,
          "duration": 4.291,
          "text": "森と海のめぐみを上手に食べていました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b03.wav",
          "start": 210.208,
          "duration": 3.011,
          "text": "食べた貝がらが積もってできた貝塚は、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b04.wav",
          "start": 213.519,
          "duration": 3.411,
          "text": "当時のくらしを知る大事な遺跡です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b05.wav",
          "start": 217.23,
          "duration": 3.491,
          "text": "ごみの山が、タイムカプセルなのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b06.wav",
          "start": 221.021,
          "duration": 5.651,
          "text": "土で作った土偶は、呪術やまじないに使われたと考えられています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b07.wav",
          "start": 226.972,
          "duration": 5.251,
          "text": "青森の三内丸山遺跡のような大きな集落もありました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b08.wav",
          "start": 232.523,
          "duration": 4.091,
          "text": "遺跡を見ると、むかしの人の毎日が見えてくるのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 237.214,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b00.wav",
          "start": 237.214,
          "duration": 3.491,
          "text": "先生、次の時代は、大ニュースなのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b01.wav",
          "start": 241.005,
          "duration": 4.571,
          "text": "紀元前10世紀ごろ、いまから約3000年前、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b02.wav",
          "start": 245.876,
          "duration": 5.331,
          "text": "大陸から稲作と金属器が伝わってきて、弥生時代が始まります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b03.wav",
          "start": 251.507,
          "duration": 3.411,
          "text": "お米!ついに米の時代なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b04.wav",
          "start": 255.218,
          "duration": 5.291,
          "text": "水稲農業は、暖かくて湿った平原や低地で始まりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b05.wav",
          "start": 260.808,
          "duration": 4.011,
          "text": "水路を作り、村人みんなで田んぼを耕します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b06.wav",
          "start": 265.119,
          "duration": 4.371,
          "text": "ところでマナブ、お米が増えると何が増えると思う?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b07.wav",
          "start": 269.79,
          "duration": 1.651,
          "text": "人が増えるのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b08.wav",
          "start": 271.741,
          "duration": 1.84,
          "text": "そのとおり!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b09.wav",
          "start": 273.881,
          "duration": 6.011,
          "text": "縄文は動いて食べ物を探したけれど、弥生は米を作って定住。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b10.wav",
          "start": 280.192,
          "duration": 3.851,
          "text": "その結果、人口も集落も増えたんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b11.wav",
          "start": 284.343,
          "duration": 3.171,
          "text": "農業が日本の歴史のエンジンなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b12.wav",
          "start": 287.814,
          "duration": 4.251,
          "text": "そのとおり。ここから日本は農業社会なんですよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 292.665,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b00.wav",
          "start": 292.665,
          "duration": 3.691,
          "text": "弥生の村には、高ーい建物があるのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b01.wav",
          "start": 296.656,
          "duration": 2.371,
          "text": "それ、高床倉庫です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b02.wav",
          "start": 299.327,
          "duration": 5.691,
          "text": "床を高く上げて、大切なお米を雨やネズミから守る倉庫なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b03.wav",
          "start": 305.318,
          "duration": 3.491,
          "text": "ネズミ先輩、お米は上げちゃダメなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b04.wav",
          "start": 309.109,
          "duration": 5.051,
          "text": "鍋や壺などの弥生土器は、縄文のものより薄くて硬く、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b05.wav",
          "start": 314.46,
          "duration": 2.131,
          "text": "煮炊きに向いていました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b06.wav",
          "start": 316.891,
          "duration": 3.611,
          "text": "道具も石から鉄へ進んでいきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b07.wav",
          "start": 320.802,
          "duration": 5.691,
          "text": "お米と鉄と土器。村の力がどんどんついていく時代なんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b08.wav",
          "start": 326.793,
          "duration": 3.731,
          "text": "村がパワーアップなのだ!それからどうなったのだ?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 331.124,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b00.wav",
          "start": 331.124,
          "duration": 4.571,
          "text": "でも先生、お米が増えると、けんかも増えちゃうのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b01.wav",
          "start": 335.995,
          "duration": 1.251,
          "text": "そのとおり。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b02.wav",
          "start": 337.546,
          "duration": 5.371,
          "text": "お米や土地をめぐる争いが始まり、村は身を守るため、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b03.wav",
          "start": 343.217,
          "duration": 4.091,
          "text": "周りに深い濠を掘った環濠集落になりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b04.wav",
          "start": 347.608,
          "duration": 3.771,
          "text": "日本で戦争が始まったのはこのころ、なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b05.wav",
          "start": 351.679,
          "duration": 4.011,
          "text": "ふぇ?戦争が始まったのは、この時代からなのだ…?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b06.wav",
          "start": 355.99,
          "duration": 6.091,
          "text": "そうなんです。お祭りに使う銅鐸、武器の銅剣もこのころのもの。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b07.wav",
          "start": 362.381,
          "duration": 3.651,
          "text": "村を率いる力の強い豪族も現れました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b08.wav",
          "start": 366.331,
          "duration": 5.691,
          "text": "時は流れて紀元後3世紀、西日本をまとめる大きな国、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b09.wav",
          "start": 372.322,
          "duration": 2.571,
          "text": "邪馬台国が登場します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b10.wav",
          "start": 375.193,
          "duration": 3.131,
          "text": "ついに本に出てくるやつなのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b11.wav",
          "start": 378.624,
          "duration": 7.491,
          "text": "邪馬台国の女王、卑弥呼は239年、中国の魏に使者を送りました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b12.wav",
          "start": 386.415,
          "duration": 4.451,
          "text": "この記録が中国の歴史書、魏志倭人伝なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b13.wav",
          "start": 391.166,
          "duration": 3.451,
          "text": "卑弥呼!歴史のスーパースターなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b14.wav",
          "start": 394.917,
          "duration": 6.771,
          "text": "さらに古い記録では、紀元57年に九州の奴国の王が、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b15.wav",
          "start": 401.988,
          "duration": 6.331,
          "text": "漢の皇帝から漢委奴国王という金印をもらったことも書かれています。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 408.919,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b00.wav",
          "start": 408.919,
          "duration": 4.851,
          "text": "ついに古墳時代なのだ!古墳って、大きなお墓なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b01.wav",
          "start": 414.07,
          "duration": 1.531,
          "text": "そのとおり。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b02.wav",
          "start": 415.901,
          "duration": 6.331,
          "text": "3世紀の中ごろから、力の強い豪族たちが巨大なお墓を作り始めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b03.wav",
          "start": 422.532,
          "duration": 4.531,
          "text": "これが古墳で、この時代を古墳時代と呼びます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b04.wav",
          "start": 427.363,
          "duration": 3.691,
          "text": "お墓が、山みたいに大きくなるのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b05.wav",
          "start": 431.354,
          "duration": 7.291,
          "text": "特徴的なのが、丸と四角をつなげた、鍵穴型のお墓。前方後円墳です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b06.wav",
          "start": 438.945,
          "duration": 4.491,
          "text": "船の形に似ている、という説明も有名なんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b07.wav",
          "start": 443.736,
          "duration": 4.291,
          "text": "上から見ると、船が海を走ってるみたいなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b08.wav",
          "start": 448.327,
          "duration": 5.411,
          "text": "これだけの土を盛れるのは、多くの人を動かせる力があるから。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b09.wav",
          "start": 454.038,
          "duration": 6.011,
          "text": "大和地方を中心に力を広げた豪族たち、つまり大和政権なんです。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 460.649,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b00.wav",
          "start": 460.649,
          "duration": 3.971,
          "text": "古墳のまわりに立ってる、土の人形はなんなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b01.wav",
          "start": 464.92,
          "duration": 6.611,
          "text": "それは埴輪。古墳の周りに並べた、素焼きの土製品なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b02.wav",
          "start": 471.831,
          "duration": 3.611,
          "text": "はにわなのだ!お顔がユニークなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b03.wav",
          "start": 475.742,
          "duration": 5.411,
          "text": "家や馬、武人など、色々な形があって、お墓を守ったり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b04.wav",
          "start": 481.453,
          "duration": 3.011,
          "text": "儀式に使ったりしたと考えられています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b05.wav",
          "start": 484.764,
          "duration": 4.211,
          "text": "お墓の中には銅鏡や剣が納められていて、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b06.wav",
          "start": 489.274,
          "duration": 3.091,
          "text": "亡くなった人の力を示しています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b07.wav",
          "start": 492.665,
          "duration": 3.371,
          "text": "馬のはにわ、走ってるみたいで好きなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 496.636,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b00.wav",
          "start": 496.636,
          "duration": 3.571,
          "text": "大和政権は、どこまで大きくなったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b01.wav",
          "start": 500.507,
          "duration": 5.771,
          "text": "各地の豪族と手を結び、鉄をもとめて朝鮮半島とも交わる、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b02.wav",
          "start": 506.578,
          "duration": 2.691,
          "text": "大きな勢力に成長します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b03.wav",
          "start": 509.569,
          "duration": 3.051,
          "text": "鉄は、道具にも武器にも必要なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b04.wav",
          "start": 512.92,
          "duration": 5.291,
          "text": "大阪の大山古墳は、仁徳天皇陵古墳とも呼ばれます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b05.wav",
          "start": 518.511,
          "duration": 6.731,
          "text": "全長約480メートル、日本最大の前方後円墳なんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b06.wav",
          "start": 525.542,
          "duration": 5.411,
          "text": "480メートル?東京タワーより長いのだ!?お墓なのに!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b07.wav",
          "start": 531.253,
          "duration": 3.531,
          "text": "まさに巨大な力のシンボルなんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b08.wav",
          "start": 535.084,
          "duration": 4.571,
          "text": "大山古墳は、おおやまこふんと読みますよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 540.255,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b00.wav",
          "start": 540.255,
          "duration": 3.291,
          "text": "古墳時代の終わりごろは、どうなってたのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b01.wav",
          "start": 543.846,
          "duration": 6.971,
          "text": "5世紀になると、大和政権の王たちは、中国の王朝に使者を送ります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b02.wav",
          "start": 551.117,
          "duration": 5.091,
          "text": "史書に名が残る五人の王を、倭の五王と呼ぶんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b03.wav",
          "start": 556.508,
          "duration": 2.971,
          "text": "海を渡って、世界進出なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b04.wav",
          "start": 559.779,
          "duration": 3.491,
          "text": "この交流を通じて漢字も伝わり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b05.wav",
          "start": 563.57,
          "duration": 3.811,
          "text": "日本にも文字の文化が芽生えていきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b06.wav",
          "start": 567.681,
          "duration": 5.251,
          "text": "日本史は次に、文字と仏教と大改革の時代へ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b07.wav",
          "start": 573.232,
          "duration": 2.731,
          "text": "それが第2話のお楽しみです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b08.wav",
          "start": 576.263,
          "duration": 3.851,
          "text": "あと少し!ポイントまとめ、お願いなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 580.914,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b00.wav",
          "start": 580.914,
          "duration": 5.451,
          "text": "ここからは、受験ポイントのまとめです!まずは旧石器と縄文。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b01.wav",
          "start": 586.665,
          "duration": 3.931,
          "text": "旧石器時代は打製石器で土器なし。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b02.wav",
          "start": 590.896,
          "duration": 6.051,
          "text": "縄文時代は磨製石器、縄文土器=世界最古級、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b03.wav",
          "start": 597.247,
          "duration": 5.211,
          "text": "竪穴住居、環状集落、そして貝塚。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b04.wav",
          "start": 602.757,
          "duration": 2.291,
          "text": "このセットを完璧に!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b05.wav",
          "start": 605.348,
          "duration": 6.091,
          "text": "打製と磨製、どっちが先?と聞かれても、もう迷いませんね。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 612.039,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b00.wav",
          "start": 612.039,
          "duration": 5.731,
          "text": "続いて弥生と古墳。今日のいちばんの狙いどころです!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b01.wav",
          "start": 618.07,
          "duration": 7.051,
          "text": "弥生時代は水稲農業=暖かく湿った平原・低地、高床倉庫、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b02.wav",
          "start": 625.421,
          "duration": 9.011,
          "text": "環濠集落=戦争のはじまり、銅鐸=祭り、銅剣=武器。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b03.wav",
          "start": 634.732,
          "duration": 5.611,
          "text": "そして239年、邪馬台国の女王・卑弥呼が魏に遣使。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b04.wav",
          "start": 640.643,
          "duration": 5.771,
          "text": "古墳時代は前方後円墳、埴輪、大和政権。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b05.wav",
          "start": 646.714,
          "duration": 3.851,
          "text": "時代とワードの対応を完璧に仕上げましょう!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 651.365,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b00.wav",
          "start": 651.365,
          "duration": 5.091,
          "text": "それでは今日の仕上げ、クイズタイム!第一問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b01.wav",
          "start": 656.756,
          "duration": 5.771,
          "text": "縄文時代に使われ始めた、石を磨いて作る石器は何でしょう?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b02.wav",
          "start": 662.827,
          "duration": 8.04,
          "text": "ア、打製石器。イ、磨製石器。ウ、銅鐸。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b03.wav",
          "start": 671.167,
          "duration": 2.04,
          "text": "えいっ、イなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b04.wav",
          "start": 673.507,
          "duration": 4.56,
          "text": "正解!石を磨くから磨製石器。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b05.wav",
          "start": 678.367,
          "duration": 6.04,
          "text": "旧石器=打製、縄文以降=磨製、ペアでしっかりね。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 685.007,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b00.wav",
          "start": 685.007,
          "duration": 1.68,
          "text": "第二問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b01.wav",
          "start": 686.987,
          "duration": 7.12,
          "text": "239年、魏に使者を送った邪馬台国の女王はだれでしょう?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b02.wav",
          "start": 694.407,
          "duration": 8.6,
          "text": "ア、卑弥呼。イ、神功皇后。ウ、推古天皇。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b03.wav",
          "start": 703.307,
          "duration": 3.0,
          "text": "歴史のスーパースター、アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b04.wav",
          "start": 706.607,
          "duration": 5.6,
          "text": "正解!卑弥呼です。記録したのは魏志倭人伝。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b05.wav",
          "start": 712.507,
          "duration": 3.8,
          "text": "239年とセットで丸暗記しましょう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 716.907,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b00.wav",
          "start": 716.907,
          "duration": 1.68,
          "text": "ラスト問題!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b01.wav",
          "start": 718.887,
          "duration": 6.96,
          "text": "弥生時代、大切なお米を雨やネズミから守るために建てた建物は?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b02.wav",
          "start": 726.147,
          "duration": 8.48,
          "text": "ア、竪穴住居。イ、高床倉庫。ウ、五重塔。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b03.wav",
          "start": 734.927,
          "duration": 3.32,
          "text": "ネズミ対策といえば、イなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b04.wav",
          "start": 738.547,
          "duration": 7.68,
          "text": "正解!高床倉庫です。高い床の上で、お米をしっかり守りました。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "section": "ending",
      "start": 747.027,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b00.wav",
          "start": 747.027,
          "duration": 3.72,
          "text": "今日は旧石器から古墳まで、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b01.wav",
          "start": 751.047,
          "duration": 3.88,
          "text": "日本史のはじまりを駆け足で見てきました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b02.wav",
          "start": 755.227,
          "duration": 5.52,
          "text": "打製・磨製、縄文土器、水稲農業、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b03.wav",
          "start": 761.047,
          "duration": 6.56,
          "text": "卑弥呼239年、前方後円墳、埴輪…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b04.wav",
          "start": 767.907,
          "duration": 3.48,
          "text": "頭の中が日本史でいっぱいなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b05.wav",
          "start": 771.687,
          "duration": 6.84,
          "text": "その調子です。次回第2話は、大化の改新はなぜ起きた?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b06.wav",
          "start": 778.827,
          "duration": 1.92,
          "text": "〜飛鳥・奈良〜。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b07.wav",
          "start": 781.047,
          "duration": 4.64,
          "text": "聖徳太子と蘇我氏の話まで、ぜひ楽しみにしていてください。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b08.wav",
          "start": 785.987,
          "duration": 5.4,
